{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.ProjectiveLineObject","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.ProjectiveLineObject","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Glossary","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.NatTrans","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.ContinuousMap.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Geometry.Manifold.IsManifold.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.InnerProductSpace.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.ExteriorAlgebra.Basic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.coinvariant_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.coinvariant_mono","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The coinvariant inclusion is a monomorphism (abstractly:\nthe coset embeds faithfully into the Hopf object). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.coinvariant_incl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.coinvariant_incl","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The coinvariant inclusion `P(V) ↪ A`: the function algebra\n`O_q(P(V)) = A^{co T}` is a sub-object of `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.action","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Action morphism `ρ : A ⊗ P(V) → P(V)` encoding the `G_q`-action\non the coset space, compatible with the Hopf multiplication. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.basePoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.basePoint","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L50-L50","doc":"Base-point morphism `∞ : 𝟙 → P(V)` (the identity coset). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.hopfObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.hopfObj","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The Frobenius–Hopf object `A` whose coset this is. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.obj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.obj","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The underlying object `P(V)` in `C` (the coset `G_q / T`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ProjectiveLineObject","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ProjectiveLineObject","kind":"structure","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.lean#L33-L60","doc":"**Projective line object** `P(V) = G_q / T` in a monoidal category.\n\nThe coset object obtained by quotienting the quantum gauge group `G_q`\nby the maximal torus `T = Aut⊗(ω|_{C₀})`.  Its function algebra is\nthe `T`-coinvariant subalgebra `O_q(P(V)) = A^{co T}`.\n\nIn the archimedean realisation: `P(V) ≅ SU(2)/U(1) ≅ CP¹`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:projective-line-object}`\nRef: [kock2004] ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:projective-line-object","label":"def:projective-line-object","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/projective-line-object.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}